  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "94048e4cffa0c7fa",
      "translationZh": "我的 YouTube 信息流里大多是歌曲、恶作剧和明星片段，所以我做了一个过滤器，用一个在 Chrome 内运行的小型决策模型来判断每条视频的标题。不会向任何地方发送任何内容：不需要服务器、API 密钥或账号，下载一次后就能离线使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f3c33e8bcdcea1ce",
      "translationZh": "隐藏你选择的视频类型（共 11 种：音乐、游戏、喜剧、视频博客、新闻、教程等），或者按照你编写的规则过滤：“隐藏关于加密货币的视频”、“只显示关于烹饪的视频”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc254b5ee531acc1",
      "translationZh": "一个开关就能隐藏 Shorts",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "67e432661dacd208",
      "translationZh": "附加功能：选中任意文本，点击鼠标右键，即可用同一个模型检查其中是否存在提示注入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fae0b91773e07871",
      "translationZh": "模型是 opendecider-nano（ONNX），通过 ONNX Runtime Web 在一个屏幕外文档中加载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2e5bda4d8c9c2ef5",
      "translationZh": "在 WebGPU 上使用 fp16（下载量为 755 MiB），没有 GPU 时在 WASM 上使用 q8（569 MiB）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f71aa4eab980ef1",
      "translationZh": "处理 40 个视频标题：在 WebGPU 上耗时 1.1 秒，在 CPU 上约耗时 15 秒（M4 Max）。模型加载期间约占用 3 GiB 内存；空闲 10 分钟后会卸载",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "efa8618695304f57",
      "translationZh": "权重通过修订版本和 SHA-256 固定。唯一的网络请求是向 Hugging Face 获取这些文件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "50aa83c8c296166c",
      "translationZh": "在 400 个 YouTube 视频上，以创作者设置的类别为标签，“隐藏音乐”“隐藏游戏”和“只看新闻”等规则的平均平衡准确率达到 0.934",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "46a0eb37beda8662",
      "translationZh": "将视频归入这 11 种类别更难：得分为 0.780。预计会有少量喜剧和脱口秀片段漏过 Focus 预设的过滤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38fc9878a1267dec",
      "translationZh": "仅在英文标题上进行了评估。如果你观看其他语言的视频，我很想知道它的表现如何",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "45e5e93901ca47a9",
      "translationZh": "试用一下（Web Store 版本正在审核中）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26be03dc979af85c",
      "translationZh": "从 https://github.com/manjunathshiva/opendecider/releases/latest 下载 opendecider-focus-0.8.1.zip 并解压",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7780eeb5d1fa9a71",
      "translationZh": "chrome://extensions → 开发者模式 → 加载已解压的扩展程序 → 选择文件夹",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d840a27b29c0e7b0",
      "translationZh": "点击图标 → 下载模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cde72d01e8393b37",
      "translationZh": "Apache-2.0。基准测试、代码和局限性：https://manjunathshiva.github.io/opendecider/guides/chrome-extension/",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9643a52d615a37d4",
      "translationZh": "这个想法来自 Quietly，它通过云端 API 实现这一功能；我想让同样的功能在设备本地运行。欢迎反馈，尤其是它有哪些地方做得不对。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "90a356b13d30445d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/manjunath_shiva 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
